WEBVTT

00:02:56.601 --> 00:03:00.167
i ludih hormona bez kontrole,

00:03:00.191 --> 00:03:04.793
to se u trenutku prevorilo u najdublji,

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:09.737
najljepši i najsretniji plač u mom životu.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:12.910
I nisam se mogla kontrolirati.

00:03:13.486 --> 00:03:15.684
Te teške suze,

00:03:15.708 --> 00:03:17.620
te sretne suze,

00:03:17.644 --> 00:03:20.224
te preplavljujuće sretne suze,

00:03:20.248 --> 00:03:22.485
nisu imale kuda nego van.

00:03:23.113 --> 00:03:24.340
I te suze,

00:03:24.364 --> 00:03:26.633
u tom trenu, taj neopisiv osjećaj

00:03:26.657 --> 00:03:30.434
koji me potaknuo da rodim
još tri mala čuda